  <result type="1">
   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Impact of the investments - jobs, environment (reduced CO2 emissions) follow on capital leveraged, micro and small enterprises benefitting.</narrative>
   </title>
   <reference code="273859" vocabulary="99"></reference>
   <indicator aggregation-status="0" ascending="1" measure="1">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Impact performance review based on the KCV Results Milestones, indicated in this Project Description.</narrative>
    </title>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2022-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2022-12-31"></period-end>
     <target value="- Cumulative 44,000households impacted, 
- Cumulative 270 micro and small enterprises benefitting from value/ supply chains supported. 
- Cumulative 12,000  (3000 direct jobs)  gainful jobs created and sustained.
- Cumulative US$ 9.2 million value of follow on capital leverage to portfolio companies. 
- Cumulative 315,000 tones of Co2 emissions reduced. 
- Portfolio IRR: 10 - 12%"></target>
     <actual value="- Cumulative 43,600 households impacted,
- Cumulative 290 micro and small enterprises benefitting from value/ supply chains supported.
- Cumulative 11,520 direct and indirect; 2,880 gainful jobs created and sustained
- US$ 9.1 million value of follow-on capital leverage to portfolio companies.
- 320,400 tones of Co2 emissions reduced.
- Portfolio IRR: IRR - 10.3% on KES (increased from 9.32% reported in July 2022), expected to hit 10.8 % in
March 2023."></actual>
    </period>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2023-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2023-12-31"></period-end>
     <target value="43,600 households impacted. 
290 micro and small enterprises benefitting from value/ supply chains supported. 
11,520 direct  and indirect  gainful jobs created and sustained.
US$ 9.1 million value of follow on capital leverage to portfolio companies. 
